---
// src/pages/privacy.astro
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy | InfraHub"
  description="InfraHub's data protection and privacy policy for infrastructure inquiries and customer data."
  canonicalPath="/privacy"
>
  <div class="section section-hero network-overlay">
    <div class="container legal-container">
      <h1 class="legal-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="legal-date">Last Updated: September 2026</p>

      <div class="legal-content">
        <h2>1. Overview & Commitment</h2>
        <p>
          InfraHub ("we", "us", "our") respects your privacy and is committed to protecting the personal and corporate data you share with us. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, process, and safeguard information submitted through <a href="https://infrahub.tech">infrahub.tech</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Data We Collect</h2>
        <p>When you submit a technical requirement or request an infrastructure offer through our qualification forms, we collect:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Contact Information:</strong> Your name, business email address, company name, and optional telephone number.</li>
          <li><strong>Technical Specifications:</strong> Details regarding your required infrastructure, bandwidth commits, geographic locations, and implementation timelines.</li>
          <li><strong>Attribution &amp; Security Data:</strong> Referral sources, campaign identifiers, landing pages, and limited request metadata used for attribution, security, and abuse prevention.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. How We Use Your Data</h2>
        <p>We use submitted information to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Review and qualify your infrastructure, connectivity, or hardware requirements.</li>
          <li>Evaluate appropriate specialist providers and sourcing options relevant to the requirement.</li>
          <li>Facilitate introductions to relevant providers when appropriate for the inquiry.</li>
          <li>Provide customer support and follow up on commercial inquiries.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. Data Sharing & Third Parties</h2>
        <p>
          InfraHub does not sell personal information as a standalone data product. Contact and technical requirement information may be shared with selected providers when needed to evaluate or progress an inquiry. Service providers used to operate the website or inquiry workflow may also process information on InfraHub's behalf.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Website Hosting, Analytics & Inquiry Dispatch</h2>
        <p>
          This website is hosted on Vercel, which processes request data such as IP address and user agent in order to serve the site. Vercel Web Analytics is enabled and collects aggregated page-view data about site usage.
        </p>
        <p>
          Inquiries submitted through the form are delivered to InfraHub&rsquo;s inquiry-handling workflow so the requirement can be reviewed and answered. Where progressing a requirement involves a specific provider or supplier, the relevant details are shared with that provider or supplier.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Data Security & Retention</h2>
        <p>
          InfraHub uses reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect submitted information. Retention depends on the inquiry, business relationship, legal obligations, and operational requirements; information should not be kept longer than reasonably necessary for those purposes.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Contact & Rights</h2>
        <p>
          Depending on the law that applies to you and the processing, you may have rights to request access to, correction of, or deletion of personal information. Privacy requests can be sent to:
        </p>
        <p class="contact-box">
          Email: <a href="mailto:privacy@infrahub.tech">privacy@infrahub.tech</a><br />
          Inquiries: <a href="mailto:inquiries@infrahub.tech">inquiries@infrahub.tech</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-container {
    max-width: 800px;
  }
  .legal-title {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .legal-date {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    padding-bottom: 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }
  .legal-content {
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  .legal-content h2 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin: 32px 0 14px;
  }
  .legal-content p {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .legal-content ul {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .legal-content li {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .contact-box {
    background-color: var(--bg-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 16px 20px;
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }
</style>
